# 换行符统一（此前两个 workflow 实测 CRLF，违反 ci.yml 自述的
# 「Unix LF 必须保留：Windows CRLF 会导致 YAML 解析错误」硬约束，且仓库无本文件）
# 默认：文本文件仓库内一律 LF（text=auto），检出按平台默认
* text=auto

# 脚本与工作流：任何平台检出都必须是 LF（CI 解析 / bash 解释）
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理：cmd.exe 要求 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产：不做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jar binary
*.asar binary
*.wasm binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.db binary
